WEBVTT

NOTE Birch & Co, distributor contacts. Monday 7 September 2026. Speakers: Iris Bell, Sam Rivera.

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Iris Bell>I've sent you the sheet. Six distributors, all from the June fair. Let me take you through it.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Sam Rivera>Go ahead.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Iris Bell>Four of the six sell pumps today. The other two only do valves, so I'd leave them aside.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Sam Rivera>Of the four, do any already carry a range like yours?

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:38.000
<v Iris Bell>Two do. They'd want exclusivity before they drop a brand they already sell. The other two have a gap in the mid-range.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Sam Rivera>What did they tell you about the market?

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:56.000
<v Iris Bell>Every one of them said the same thing: mid-range buyers in the Nordics want next-day spares more than a low price.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:04.000
<v Sam Rivera>That's useful. I'll use the four as a check on the share figures, not as the source of them.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.000
<v Iris Bell>Good. I don't want the memo built on fair gossip.
